<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{{appTitle}} Ownership Review</title>
    <style>
      body, table, td, a { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f5f7;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        color: #172b4d;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 640px;
        margin: 24px auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        padding: 40px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        border: 1px solid #dfe1e6;
      }
      .header {
        border-bottom: 2px solid #0052cc;
        padding-bottom: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .header h2 { color: #0052cc; margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 20px; }
      .header p { margin: 0; color: #6b778c; font-size: 13px; }
      .callout {
        background-color: #fff0b3;
        border-left: 4px solid #ff991f;
        padding: 12px 16px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      .cta-btn {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #0052cc;
        color: #ffffff !important;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 12px 24px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 15px;
        margin: 8px 0 24px 0;
      }
      .section-title {
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #172b4d;
        margin: 24px 0 8px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #ebecf0;
        padding-bottom: 6px;
      }
      table.breakdown {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        font-size: 13px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }
      table.breakdown th {
        background-color: #f4f5f7;
        text-align: left;
        padding: 8px 10px;
        color: #6b778c;
        font-weight: normal;
        border-bottom: 2px solid #dfe1e6;
      }
      table.breakdown td {
        padding: 8px 10px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #ebecf0;
      }
      table.breakdown td.count {
        text-align: right;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #172b4d;
      }
      .glossary { background-color: #f4f5f7; border-radius: 4px; padding: 14px 16px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
      .glossary dt { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 8px; }
      .glossary dd { margin: 2px 0 0 0; color: #6b778c; }
      .footer {
        margin-top: 32px;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #6b778c;
        text-align: center;
        border-top: 1px solid #dfe1e6;
        padding-top: 20px;
      }
      a { color: #0052cc; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h2>{{appTitle}}: Ownership Issues to Review</h2>
        <p>Catalog health digest &mdash; {{periodLabel}}</p>
      </div>

      <p>Hello <strong>{{teamName}}</strong>,</p>

      <p>
        Your team has <strong>{{totalCount}} {{#if (eq totalCount 1)}}entity{{else}}entities{{/if}}</strong>
        in the {{appTitle}} catalog with outstanding ownership issues. Keeping catalog data accurate
        helps the platform route alerts, route incident escalations, and support discovery correctly.
      </p>

      <div class="callout">
        <strong>Action required:</strong> Please review and resolve the ownership issues listed below.
      </div>

      <a class="cta-btn" href="{{queueUrl}}">Review your team's ownership queue &rarr;</a>

      <div class="section-title">Breakdown by issue type</div>
      <table class="breakdown">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Issue type</th>
            <th style="text-align:right">Count</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {{#each checkBreakdown}}
          <tr>
            <td>{{this.title}}</td>
            <td class="count">{{this.count}}</td>
          </tr>
          {{/each}}
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <div class="section-title">Breakdown by entity kind</div>
      <table class="breakdown">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Kind</th>
            <th style="text-align:right">Count</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {{#each kindBreakdown}}
          <tr>
            <td>{{this.kind}}</td>
            <td class="count">{{this.count}}</td>
          </tr>
          {{/each}}
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <div class="section-title">What do these issue types mean?</div>
      <dl class="glossary">
        <dt>No owner (orphaned)</dt>
        <dd>The catalog YAML for this entity has no <code>spec.owner</code> set, or it is set to a placeholder value like <code>unknown</code>. Add your team as the owner in the entity YAML.</dd>
        <dt>Dissolved team (zombie)</dt>
        <dd>The <code>spec.owner</code> references a group or user that no longer exists in the catalog. Update the entity YAML to point to an active team.</dd>
      </dl>

      {{#if supportUrl}}
      <p>
        Need help? Reach out via
        <a href="{{supportUrl}}">{{appTitle}} support</a>.
      </p>
      {{/if}}

      <p>Best regards,<br />The {{appTitle}} Team</p>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>
          This is an automated digest from
          <a href="{{appBaseUrl}}">{{appTitle}}</a>.
          You are receiving this because your team has entities with open ownership cases.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
